Z||000010||Neal||07-31-2001||09:01 PM||||The fiero exaust is stainless steel, wrap it and dont worry about rust.  The rust colour on the surface is just because gm cheaped out and didnt use top grade stainless.<P>So by all means wrap fiero exaust||||reg||1
